# NOTE: frontend/generated/eligibility-proofs.json is intentionally NOT
# ignored. It has to be committed and pushed to main so GitHub Pages
# actually serves it — otherwise apply.html can never auto-fill anyone's
# eligibility proof, because the file it fetches simply isn't there on
# the live site. Only the root-level scratch folder (if you ever use one)
# is ignored below.
/generated/
